    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "With only eight regular-season games remaining, the franchise executed a bold, high-leverage intervention, firing its coach to pivot the system. The catalyst who arrived, a mid-season interventionist, then engineered a rapid system recalibration, guiding a 7-0-1 close that completely transformed the team's trajectory.",
