      "fit": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The franchise's new coaching strategy proved potent in the playoff series. The mid-season interventionist leveraged momentum through the bracket, advancing through the playoffs past Utah and Anaheim. This series victory set the stage for the ultimate test: the Western Conference Final, the system's decisive leverage point.",
