      ],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The decisive moment arrived at the system's decisive leverage point, the conference final. The strategic operators executed a disciplined defensive performance, shutting down a crippled system. This swift, total system override, a four-game sweep completed on May 26, was the transformed outcome—securing their championship series qualification and a spot in the Stanley Cup Final.",
